      "predicate": [
        "DECISION PROCEDURE on abi123_trunc_* (hi != lo, both nonzero), because the",
        "shipped answer is not any single wrong value but a TOTALISATION:",
        "  L(R) == R          -> ABI-2 and ABI-3 both satisfied on this record",
        "  L(R) == swap(R)    -> ABI-3 VIOLATED (hi and lo exchanged)",
        "  L(R) neither        -> ABI-2 VIOLATED: the lane is not reading the two",
        "                           halves of this record at all.  Shipped node",
        "                           answers ` : ` here, which is the third case."
      ],
      "fixed_by": "`.agents/slop/jsfix/jsfix_gate.py`, 30 rows x 10 arms, every arm matched to an exact Python model.  It adds the OUTBOUND-only plant that this gate could not see: the inbound plant moves 28/30 and the outbound plant 30/30, and the 2 rows only the outbound one moves are floor_mod|-8|4 and cmod|-8|4."
    },
    {
      "id": "ABI-3",
      "name": "pair order: the value is (hi << 32) | lo",
      "statement": [
        "The two U32 words of an I64 are ordered HIGH FIRST.  hi is bits 63..32,",
        "lo is bits 31..0.  Both lanes, both directions."
      ],
      "shipped_bug": {
