        "did": "io_tup and H.I64 are both 2-field constructors laid out alike, so",
        "answered": "C and JS agree on (hi<<32|lo) by coincidence",
        "fixed_at": "n/a -- nothing is broken yet, which is exactly why nothing checks it"
