      "measured_by": "`.agents/slop/abi4/abi4_gate.py`: 98 rows x 15 arms, `tinygrad.dtype` CALLED for every expectation.  NEEDS(s) = rows green under the full repair and RED without s.  FIXES(s) = rows s fixes ALONE.",
